# Excel Financial Analysis Dashboard

## Project Overview
An interactive financial dashboard developed using Microsoft Excel to analyse investment performance using Present Value (PV) and Future Value (FV).

## Key Features
- Present Value (PV) calculation
- Future Value (FV) calculation
- PV vs FV comparison chart
- Investment performance indicators
- Dynamic dashboard KPIs
- Investment recommendation indicators
- Automated last-updated date
- Dynamic financial formulas

## Tools & Technologies
- Microsoft Excel
- Financial Functions
- Data Validation
- Charts & Data Visualization
- Conditional Formatting

## Project Objective
To understand and demonstrate the Time Value of Money concept through practical financial modelling and interactive data visualization.

## Skills Demonstrated
- Financial Analysis
- Excel Dashboard Development
- Financial Modelling
- Data Visualization
- Analytical Thinking

## Project Status
Completed.
